                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-medium-gray-text">To utilize our <code class="font-mono text-visionary-gold bg-gray-900/60 px-2 py-1 rounded">PRISM Framework</code> (Pattern Recognition for Integrated Sentient Meaning) to cultivate understanding.</p>
