                <p>So she may have had a pea on her brain, but she could see that nothing in this place worked how it should, and nothing made sense. In fact, the real kicker is that it was actually the very disorganization of the royal bureaucracy that the princess was able to just slide in there unperturbed. However, this did not mean that the adjacent offices and administration ceased their functions; now, quite contrary. They went on continuing to fuck shit up for the constituents to such a degree that it could it could be the only possible reason the princess was day in, day out seeing complainants personally face to face.</p>
                
