                transliteration: "ḥubbuka nādirun wa gharībun. 'abra al-baḥri al-ḥubbu wa al-nūri",
                english: "Your love rare and strange. Across the sea the love and the light",
                spanish: "Tu amor raro y extraño. A través del mar el amor y la luz"
